{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17105","headline":"南至日隔霜仗望含元殿炉烟 · 王良士","name":"南至日隔霜仗望含元殿炉烟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"抗殿疏龙首，高高接上玄。\n节当南至日，星是北辰天。\n宝戟罗仙仗，金炉引御烟。\n霏微双阙丽，容曳九门连。\n拂曙祥光满，分晴瑞色鲜。\n一阳今在历，生植仰陶甄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王良士","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}